# SPEC-0013's canonical workload on one machine: 10,000 World entities over
# a square field a kilometer wide, 2,048 of them walking under Kest, and
# each player sent what is within 90 meters, about 256 entities. Players
# steer as in the arena; everything else stands where it was placed.
program crowd.kest

component 5bb8316e-e458-42fe-a415-82d2f103be9c crowd.position Position
component c0c7d3dd-bca3-41cc-b4d1-00bd619bc536 crowd.steer Steer
component 23609d85-742e-4417-97b0-ab804903ecab crowd.walk Walk
component 3381c499-7c6e-4fa0-9439-24bae45cc7fe crowd.placed Placed

system crowd.scatter simulation scatter write crowd.position without crowd.placed entities random place
system crowd.walk simulation walk write crowd.position read crowd.walk after crowd.scatter
system crowd.drive simulation drive write crowd.position read crowd.steer predicted

# Walkers cross the field in two directions; the rest stand.
spawn 1024 crowd.position crowd.walk dx=0.05 dy=0
spawn 1024 crowd.position crowd.walk dx=0 dy=-0.05
spawn 7888 crowd.position

replicate crowd.position crowd.steer
player crowd.position crowd.steer
input crowd.steer
predict crowd.position crowd.steer
interest crowd.position x y within 90
interpolate crowd.position
